## Executive Summary

Gemini 4 Argon is Google's flagship general-purpose model from their Gemini family, released September 30, 2026, featuring a massive 1M token context window, highly competitive pricing ($2/$10 per 1M tokens during introductory period through November 30, 2026), and strong performance across agentic benchmarks (82.9 score on Terminal-Bench-Science 0.1). Argon ranks #1 on Terminal-Bench-Science 0.1 among all models with verified scores, and offers 50% cheaper input pricing than Claude Opus 5.5 ($2/$10 vs $4/$20). The model is available to Google AI Pro and Ultra subscribers in the Gemini app starting October 13, 2026. Argon shares the same underlying architecture with Gemini 3.8 Flash but includes enhanced reasoning capabilities and better cost efficiency.

