## Strengths

1. **Exceptional Terminal-Bench Performance:** 82.9 on Terminal-Bench-Science 0.1 (best verified score among all models)
2. **Cost Efficiency:** 50% cheaper input pricing than Claude Opus 5.5 ($2/$10 vs $4/$20)
3. **Massive Context Window:** 1,000,000 tokens enables complex, multi-hour workflows
4. **High Cache Efficiency:** 95% cheaper cache reads ($0.10 vs $2 per 1M tokens during introductory period)
5. **Google Ecosystem Integration:** Seamless integration with Google AI, Cloud Vertex AI, and Gemini app
6. **Knowledge Cutoff:** Not specified (likely current)
7. **Enterprise Integration:** Available through Google Cloud Vertex AI
8. **Multimodal Capabilities:** Text and image input, text output support
9. **Adaptive Thinking:** Always-on thinking for enhanced reasoning
10. **Long Decode Support:** Up to 1,048,576 output tokens for long-form content

